<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
<p class="lede">These terms apply when you use <a href="/">heynimo.in</a> and when you join the Nimo waitlist. By using the site you agree to them.</p>

<h2 id="site">1. About this site</h2>
<p>This website is operated by Nimo Robotics Inc. It exists to introduce Nimo, an AI companion robot in development, and to let interested people join a waitlist.</p>

<h2 id="waitlist">2. The waitlist</h2>
<ul>
<li>Joining the waitlist is <strong>free</strong> and creates <strong>no obligation</strong> on either side.</li>
<li>It is <strong>not an order, a reservation, or a purchase</strong>. It does not guarantee you a unit, a price, or a delivery date.</li>
<li>We may contact you by email about Nimo's development and launch. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
<li>Please submit your own email address. We may remove entries that appear automated, abusive, or fraudulent.</li>
</ul>

