<p>Nimo is still in development. Everything shown on this site &mdash; including imagery, described features, expressions, colorways and timelines &mdash; represents our current design intent and <strong>may change or may not appear in a final product at all</strong>. Product visuals on this site are concept renders, not photographs of a finished device. Nothing on this site is an offer to sell or a binding commitment to ship.</p>

